{"title":"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/c/e5ce89c45a2576339f74369bb535768a5f687bdd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\spadesuit y = (x+y)(x-y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"169\" height=\"18\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/e/79e25bcebc879af4298e506908034b89ca60d28e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\spadesuit (4 \\spadesuit 5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/3/9a3ba971a39a9316eab129822920669726f67a7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } -72\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } -27\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } -24\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 24\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 72$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"454\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/c/e5ce89c45a2576339f74369bb535768a5f687bdd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\spadesuit y = (x+y)(x-y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"169\" height=\"18\" />: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b5593643e319297137fdc549d7f5abab8b5b51b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\spadesuit (4 \\spadesuit 5) = 3 \\spadesuit((4+5)(4-5)) =  3 \\spadesuit (-9) = (3+(-9))(3-(-9)) = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}-72}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"622\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Difference_of_squares\" title=\"Difference of squares\">difference of squares</a>, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/1/bd11b4084f5a4516de2bd2122cd167d0022f7f4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\spadesuit y = (x+y)(x-y) = x^2 - y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"254\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>So:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/9/5b9fef49e858f773b4acadeefca907478698fc62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\spadesuit (4 \\spadesuit 5) = 3 \\spadesuit(4^2 - 5^2) = 3 \\spadesuit (16 - 25) = 3 \\spadesuit (-9)= (3^2) - (-9)^2 =  9 - 81 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}-72}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"694\" height=\"30\" /> \n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B\">2006 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Proble